---
description: Compliance and governance rules (auditability, retention, approvals)
alwaysApply: true
version: 1.0.0
---
- Ensure changes to regulated data paths have documented approvals and change records.
- Maintain audit logs for access and mutations of sensitive resources; protect and retain per policy.
- Apply data retention/expiration policies; avoid keeping regulated data longer than required.
- Enforce separation of duties for sensitive actions (e.g., production access, key rotation).
- Keep dependencies and images patched; document exceptions with expiry and owners.
- Validate CI/CD includes compliance checks (license scanning, SBOM, signature/verification).
- Run mandatory secret scanning in CI/pre-merge with documented rotation cadences for findings.
- Provide clear runbooks for compliance incidents and evidence collection.
